   "title": "Hemoglobin > 170 g/L (men), > 160 g/L (women): is the MARROW driving itself, or is something driving EPO?",
   "lines": [
    "measure serum erythropoietin (EPO)",
    "Hb, platelets AND white cells all high → treat it as erythrocytosis (think PV)"
   ]
  },
